        }
      ],
      "note": "The row is one added property on a whole-value field, so the entire superseded value is re-emitted. The engine half — a GRANTED Domain Initiate (a cloistered cleric gets theirs from the doctrine, not from a slot) counting towards the limit — is a build.ts fix, without which this row would narrow the picker to the wrong set."
